{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22084","headline":"新乐府 紫毫笔\t讥失职也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 紫毫笔\t讥失职也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫毫笔，尖如锥兮利如刀。\n江南石上有老兔，吃竹饮泉生紫毫。\n宣城之人采爲笔，千万毛中拣一毫。\n毫虽轻，功甚重，管勒工名充岁贡。\n君兮臣兮勿轻用，勿轻用，将何如。\n愿赐东西府御史，愿颁左右台起居。\n搦管趋入黄金阙，抽毫立在白玉除。\n臣有奸邪正衙奏，君有动言直笔书。\n起居郎，侍御史，尔知紫毫不易致。\n每岁宣城进笔时，紫毫之价如金贵。\n慎勿空将弹失仪，慎勿空将录制词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}